因是 **Liveness Probe 探测失败**。\n*   证据 #1 和 #2 明确显示 Kubelet 持续收到探活请求的 `HTTP 500` 错误，并随后执行了 `Killing` 操作。\n*   证据 #3 和 #4 确认了容器因收到 `SIGKILL` (Exit 137, reason=Error) 而退出，非内存溢出。\n\n**缺失的决定性事实：**\n日志和追踪记录中未捕获到探活请求失败时的具体堆栈或异常信息。\n*   证据 #7 和 #8 仅记录了成功的 `HTTP 200` 业务请求，表明应用主业务逻辑可能正常，或者应用将探活请求与业务请求混用且仅在探活时触发特定逻辑。\n*   目前无法确认应用返回 500 的具体代码级原因（如：特定的 Bug、依赖服务暂时不可用、或探针逻辑本身设计缺陷），需进一步检查应用代码逻辑以区分是业务故障还是探活接口误报。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 2.0m\n├─ 问题定位: 23.7s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 80.1s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-10/workload-79d9f8fd88-bsn84: 80.1s (Evidence 68.8s, RCA 11.2s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 14.4s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-10/workload-79d9f8fd88-bsn84**: pod-crashloop-runtime, pod-oomkilled\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 118.188, "metrics": {"run_id": "d81d51e454ae4352", "mttr": {"value": "2.0m", "seconds": 118.19168829917908, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "45%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-oomkilled, pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.85, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.09}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.06}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.12, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "已匹配（未识别核心）"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 118191.68829917908, "llm_calls": 11, "llm_duration_ms": 100395.41459083557, "tool_calls": 12, "executed_tool_calls": 12, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 0, "successful_tool_calls": 12, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 37281.99815750122, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 17407.964944839478}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 23651.00932121277, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 80101.86266899109, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 14415.30442237854, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

